      "created_at": "2013-01-23T01:30:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Pretty much.&nbsp; Details are scarce, but I dunno if you want to tell your seven year-old that Expat's mom is the reason why she's missing an eye.&nbsp; You know your kid better than we do, but if you're wary of sharing the mommy issues I'd go with the answer \"From fighting crime.\"</p>",
